# ── MARK LIII — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
config/api_keys.json          # your Gemini API key, plus per-plugin credentials
config/certs/                 # the dashboard's TLS private key and certificate
config/device_sessions.json   # paired-device tokens; each one doubles as AES
                              # key material for that device's dashboard traffic
config/whatsapp_web/          # a LINKED WhatsApp session — committing it hands
                              # somebody your WhatsApp account, not just a key
**/token*.json                # Google OAuth tokens (Gmail / Calendar plugins)
**/client_secret*.json        # Google OAuth client secrets
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/
tasks/queue/*.json
tasks/done/*.json
tasks/.worker.lock

# ── JARVIS Runtime State (generated at runtime, not source code) ────────────────
jarvis_instruction_log.json
jarvis_voice_history.json
whatsapp_message_history.json
jarvis_voice_cache/
optimized_prompts_history.json
qdrant_collections_init_results.json

# Laufzeit-Geheimnisse (nie einchecken)
config/device_sessions.json
config/certs/

# MIA desktop import
memory/calendar/
brain/memory/
brain/ingestion/
brain/indexes/
brain/system/state/
brain/system/sessions/
config/api_keys.json
# MIA server-only runtime state and bridge secrets
config/command_center_bridge_device_token
data/
learned_repos/
brain/system/health/
dashboard/static/confirm_test.md
.claude_fix_status.json
scripts/ollama_keepalive_payload.json
